#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:112
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`default invoice layout <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout>` has"
" not been customized yet, a :guilabel:`Configure your document layout` pop-"
"up window appears. Configure the layout and click :guilabel:`Continue`."
