#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:353
msgid ""
"To find a list of all the model's fields and their technical names, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal Items`, and click the :icon:`fa-bug` "
":guilabel:`(bug)` icon, then click :guilabel:`Fields`. The technical name of"
