#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:112
msgid ""
"To reimburse multiple expense reports at once, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> Expense Reports` to view all expense "
"reports in a list view. Next, select the expense reports to be reimbursed."
msgstr ""
