"visszatérítendő költségjelentéseket."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:121
msgid ""
"Adjust the :guilabel:`STATUS` filter on the left side to only show "
":guilabel:`Posted` expense reports. This displays **only** expense reports "
