#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:660
msgid ":guilabel:`Vendor`: This field should be an employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Szállító`: Ennek a mezőnek egy alkalmazottat kell tartalmaznia."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:661
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: Verify that this field is accurately populated "
