msgid ""
"If you need to add an addendum to the invoice, you can do so in the "
":guilabel:`Terms and Conditions` field. The addendum will be included in the"
" XML document and can be used to provide additional information or notes "
"related to the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Ha kiegészítést kell hozzáadni a számlához, azt a :guilabel:`Feltételek és "
