#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:223
msgid ""
"Open the `NIC e-Invoice portal <https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/>`_ and go to "
":menuselection:`Search --> Verify Signed Invoice`;"
msgstr ""
"Nyissa meg a `NIC e-Invoice portal <https://einvoice1.gst.gov.in/>`_ oldalt,"
" és lépjen a :menuselection:`Keresés --> Aláírt számla ellenőrzése` "
